{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "35f14d18c07e65fd9deb5aab9166e043360fa937a0bf1d7e79b8f5ec565e425e", "ja": "（今日は人気SFドラマ『ミリオンアーマー』\nシリーズの撮影日。のり子の熱演が光っている……）", "zh": "（今天是人气科幻剧《百万装甲》系列的拍摄日。纪子的精彩演技正熠熠生辉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "42d3c97cf8209391994853745e00242c71bc5b1584516a02e0ced95925a36ae7", "ja": "「アイツらは強敵だよ。でも、アタシたちが\n力を合わせれば、絶対に負けたりなんかしない！」", "zh": "「那群家伙是强敌。但是，只要我们\n齐心协力，就绝对不会输给他们！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "b6fe18c3560e9f8ca1c39ddd9758f875328cdc71050b4c977ec01ab70e29b0e7", "ja": "「大丈夫、アタシたちは強い！　この手で必ず、\n平和な世界を掴みとろう！　よーし、行くよっ！」", "zh": "「没事的，我们很强！一定要用这双手，\n夺回和平的世界！好——上吧！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1003_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a857e181a90a9d089c66a85dfd5c9a91111c8e6692700f0ebb4823599436ba4c", "ja": "のり子、お疲れ様！　難しいシーンだったけど、\n一発OKなんて凄いじゃないか！", "zh": "纪子，辛苦了！虽然是很难的场景，但居然一次就通过了，真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "ea2d5a261925818dded78cc7856f73f1dbf14254b49f50dc9614f39f1488e4a2", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとっ！　難しいこと考えないで、\n思いっきり振り切ってみたのがよかったのかな？", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖！不去想那些复杂的事，尽情发挥了一把，看来这样做是对的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2c806c2e203d98ff4ff0d737f7d3aaea4456336dbb8486f089935f9785c44fc7", "ja": "そうだと思う。監督さんも、\nのり子の演技がハマってるって褒めていたよ。", "zh": "我觉得就是这样。导演也夸你说，诺莉子的演技非常到位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "516a9bee9742ff687500b9db925c7854aaf5f7b0a37904e9b524916df8ae7587", "ja": "ホントに？　じつはアタシもさ、作中のノリコが\n自分の中にスッと入ってくる感覚があったんだ。", "zh": "真的吗？其实我也有这种感觉，剧中的诺莉子仿佛一下子融入了我的内心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "e8de49a243f0a4c1f327b5f3ef373db98ab413cc5a3a56126e10caab55d01307", "ja": "平和を守るために戦う。仲間がピンチだから助ける。\n裏表とか、打算のないまっすぐな気持ち……。", "zh": "为了守护和平而战。因为同伴陷入危机所以出手相救。\n表里如一、毫无算计的纯粹心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "1357f75a6c69b20be0581bcb5fac1bb6a5981a0e3f96664418011959b6638112", "ja": "なんか、そういうのにシンクロしたっていうか……。\n自然に演技できた気がするよ。", "zh": "总觉得……就像和那种感觉产生了共鸣……\n好像自然而然就演出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1010_p", "source_sha256": "32820badbda1f388ba0c00c224035074db0e0ea3ee883deb0959245b1237b589", "ja": "なるほど。台本から読み取ったことを\n素直に演じた結果ってことだな。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，这是把从剧本中读到的内容\n坦率地演绎出来的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "9de88f1392f07b0f3a29a7f2c64f37769e45cdb9c422661aaa63b0637b8ae50c", "ja": "うん……あ！　だからって、何も考えてないわけじゃ\nないよ？　あくまで考えすぎないってだけで……！", "zh": "嗯……啊！但这不代表我什么都没想哦？\n只是没有想得太多而已……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f61abc571bd44b58e4ba696e50566f75ea6432dfff517d82eaa8754bb8ddaff9", "ja": "はは、わかってるよ。むしろ納得したくらいだ。\nのり子と『ノリコ』に共通点が多かったんだなって。", "zh": "哈哈，我明白的。反而觉得很有道理。\n原来纪子和“Noriko”有这么多共同点啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "3ceebcc4f986ae87c99f783ce331598885f578e0e8522f6cb1a9431253ad268b", "ja": "そ、そう？　{$P$}から見て、\nアタシって……こんな感じなの？", "zh": "是、是吗？在{$P$}看来，我……是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7b1fbe7b8bc2e87038d0ae28fe9d558bfa2feaac433faa72c7dee62ed8eb288a", "ja": "うん。仲間想いで、気持ちにまっすぐなところとか\nそっくりだと思ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯。比如重视同伴、对自己的心情很坦率这几点，\n我觉得都特别像哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "6707e0e053fe5d18c551e68bb23e2b4e359f65d613fa193a9fb7743be2f2d745", "ja": "ひゃ～！？　そ、そんなストレートに褒められると、\nさすがに照れるって……！", "zh": "呀～！？被、被这么直白地夸，果然还是会害羞的啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "aa7b3e490e50e72d7c91535ccdd94670064fa9d189259436ed855dced4612ef9", "ja": "でも……ありがと。ノリコってさ、\nいつかこうなりたいって理想の自分に近いんだ。", "zh": "不过……谢谢你。你所说的那个理想中的自己，和我很接近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "fa2ad256933b47c8da8c1313b0a2225102ff9dc714987ef88fcd65db7f6724c9", "ja": "だから似てるって言われて、ちょっと嬉しい。\nアタシもちょっとは成長してるのかな？って。", "zh": "所以被说很像，还是有点开心的。\n我是不是也有一点点成长了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6454ac0139f24e1cb3d1bc8ac9bf9cb0958832367957fab1afcf97b6afbf5682", "ja": "そうだな。……っと、そろそろ撮影が再開するな。\n次はいよいよ、メインのアクションシーンだ！", "zh": "是啊。……对了，差不多要重新开始拍摄了。\n接下来终于要拍主要的动作戏了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "70c2a02aecad3ae899a1d20131a00e9dece50e40b1e0ceef976713416f18e57d", "ja": "任せて！　{$P$}のおかげで、\n最高の演技ができるって自信が、確信に変わったから！", "zh": "交给我吧！多亏了{$P$}，\n我有自信能拿出最棒的演技，这份自信已经变成确信了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0534_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "489240ecdaf10bb7e37c75c607df9d50d9afe9c1a40c0058bb86fcbc1c1f95b2", "ja": "理想のアタシ全開で、みんなの心にまっすぐ刺さる……\nそんな演技にしてみせるよ！", "zh": "我要让这场演出充满理想中的我，笔直地刺入大家的心中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
